---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Resume | Abhishek Guha">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Background &amp; experience</p><h1>Experience,<br /><em>in perspective.</em></h1><p class="lead">Backend engineering, distributed systems, and building software that can evolve.</p></header>
  <section class="resume-note"><span class="note-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><h2>A fuller picture is on its way.</h2><p>A detailed resume hasn't been published here yet. You can read more about my interests and approach, or explore the writing already in the notebook.</p><div class="links"><a class="button" href="/about/">About me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read my writing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  h1 em { color: var(--accent); }
  .resume-note { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 30px; max-width: 850px; }
  .note-symbol { font-size: 45px; color: var(--rust); line-height: 1; }
  .resume-note h2 { font-size: 32px; }
  .resume-note p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 600px; margin-block: 20px 28px; }
  .links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 25px; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 540px) { .note-symbol { display: none; } }
</style>
